      "reason": "Two comments asked to reject symlinked source ancestors and to prevent symlink traversal when writing generated roots. No fix commit, no issue and no maintainer acceptance exist in the history, so there is no confirmed label to score against; a probe would have to guess intent. Dropped, not adjusted."
    },
